  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.34 Electrocardiogram (ECG) machine",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.34 “Electrocardiogram (ECG) machine” means a device used to record the electrical energy generated by the heart, and its movement through the heart, the results of which are displayed on a paper strip, a display screen, or both. The term includes “cardiac monitor”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
